;
; How Ratchet files one part of a machine's parts tree in MYRA
; (ratchet_rules.h RR7): a sparse record under the machine and the part,
; with the part it is fitted to (its parent, 0 for the machine itself), its
; kind and the hours it has run. The model asks whether the numbers fit
; before it keeps the part.
^ZXRATCHET(machine:i4, part:i6) = parent:i6! ^ kind:i2! ^ hours:i9!
